./xmodel/sol-approaches.log:15165:+- **Precise obstruction.** Higher-genus, many-punctured affine curves can carry exact/nonvanishing differentials with all poles and cancellations at infinity. One must control the whole pencil and variation of punctures, not a single formal fiber; current residue-A data leave resolution tails unpinned.
