For a B-series with same-direction contact sum S_i (5 pairs, units
1/42): ord_u(g - c_p) = (282 - S_i)/42, so a B-place of degree n_p has

    e_p = n_p (282 - S_p)/42,  integer, 1 <= e_p, and <= 6 by the
