xmodel/grok-approaches.md-213-
xmodel/grok-approaches.md-214-**(a)** JC in all dimensions reduces to the invertibility of cubic homogeneous (or cubic-linear Drużkowski) maps. Prove those; get all of JC, hence JC2.
